  "description": "Removal of conditions 2, 3, and 4 (acoustic mitigation) attached to planning permission ref 2025/2581 dated 20/02/2026 for the retrospective application for the installation of two air conditioning condenser units on rear single-storey flat roof and the erection of associated screening.&nbsp;The variation would remove the requirement to install post-installation acoustic mitigation.",
